{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-2097","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2313","text":"The Compose Runtime — CC2 "},{"id":"spn-2314","marks":["code"],"text":"compose"},{"id":"spn-2315","text":", made authorable (design note)"}]},{"id":"blk-2098","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2316","marks":["bold"],"text":"Status:"},{"id":"spn-2317","text":" design proposal — "},{"id":"spn-2318","marks":["bold"],"text":"partly shipped."},{"id":"spn-2319","text":" Slice 1 items 4 and 5 have landed: "},{"id":"spn-2320","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box/compose.mjs"},{"id":"spn-2321","text":" (1,603 lines, zero deps — it was 461 when this line was written, and most of the growth is the argument for each refusal rather than the refusals themselves) and "},{"id":"spn-2322","marks":["code"],"text":"test/compose-laws.mjs"},{"id":"spn-2323","text":" exist and run. The surface (item 6) and the worked demo (item 7) do not. · "},{"id":"spn-2324","marks":["bold"],"text":"Reviewable against:"},{"id":"spn-2325","text":" "},{"id":"spn-2326","marks":["code"],"text":"CC2-capability-composition.md"},{"id":"spn-2327","text":" (§2 operators, §3 coalition), "},{"id":"spn-2328","marks":["code"],"text":"UMBRELLA.md"},{"id":"spn-2329","text":" (the "},{"id":"spn-2330","marks":["code"],"text":"compose"},{"id":"spn-2331","text":" stage), "},{"id":"spn-2332","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box"},{"id":"spn-2333","text":" (8 rungs; the suites derive "},{"id":"spn-2334","marks":["bold"],"text":"210 enforced"},{"id":"spn-2335","text":" laws + 3 declared-open — never hand-type this, run them) · "},{"id":"spn-2336","marks":["bold"],"text":"Surface home:"},{"id":"spn-2337","text":" "},{"id":"spn-2338","marks":["code"],"text":"weave/forge.html"},{"id":"spn-2339","text":" (the lego canvas) · "},{"id":"spn-2340","marks":["bold"],"text":"Runtime home:"},{"id":"spn-2341","text":" "},{"id":"spn-2342","marks":["code"],"text":"AmpersandBoxDesign/box-and-box/compose.mjs"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2100","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2343","text":"One line: turn the "},{"id":"spn-2344","marks":["bold"],"text":"one unfinished stage of the [&] pipeline"},{"id":"spn-2345","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-2346","marks":["code"],"text":"compose"},{"id":"spn-2347","text":" (lawless "},{"id":"spn-2348","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2349","text":", no coalition runtime) — into a small lawful runtime, and make it authorable in the Forge as bricks you snap together. Each brick carries "},{"id":"spn-2350","marks":["italic"],"text":"invariant · laws · enforcement · feedback · adaptation"},{"id":"spn-2351","text":"; composing bricks yields another brick. The verdict is the arithmetic."}]}],"id":"blk-2099","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-2101","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2352","text":"1. Why this, why now"}]},{"id":"blk-2102","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2353","marks":["code"],"text":"UMBRELLA.md"},{"id":"spn-2354","text":" lists seven stages: "},{"id":"spn-2355","marks":["code"],"text":"declare → validate → compose → govern → wire → run → observe"},{"id":"spn-2356","text":". Every stage has a shipped engine "},{"id":"spn-2357","marks":["bold"],"text":"except `compose`"},{"id":"spn-2358","text":", which is marked "},{"id":"spn-2359","marks":["italic"],"text":"\"`&` ✅ · `|>` still lawless · cross-agent coalition compose ❌.\""},{"id":"spn-2360","text":" "},{"id":"spn-2361","marks":["code"],"text":"CC2-capability-composition.md"},{"id":"spn-2362","text":" already specifies the missing piece normatively ("},{"id":"spn-2363","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-2364","text":" lattice, "},{"id":"spn-2365","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2366","text":" governed monoid, the coalition object, rung-by-rung admissibility) — but when this note was written it was "},{"id":"spn-2367","marks":["bold"],"text":"draft, no runtime"},{"id":"spn-2368","text":": schema + "},{"id":"spn-2369","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box lift"},{"id":"spn-2370","text":" existed, the compose runtime and lawful "},{"id":"spn-2371","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2372","text":" did not. "},{"id":"spn-2373","marks":["bold"],"text":"That has since changed"},{"id":"spn-2374","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-2375","marks":["code"],"text":"compose.mjs"},{"id":"spn-2376","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-2377","marks":["code"],"text":"test/compose-laws.mjs"},{"id":"spn-2378","text":" shipped, and "},{"id":"spn-2379","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2380","text":" now carries "},{"id":"spn-2381","marks":["bold"],"text":"4"},{"id":"spn-2382","text":" enforced laws (CP1–CP4) with 4 more (CP5–CP7, CD6) declared-open and printing FALSIFIED. The "},{"id":"spn-2383","marks":["code"],"text":"compose"},{"id":"spn-2384","text":" stage is no longer lawless; it is lawful with four published holes. <!-- law-count:frozen --> "},{"id":"spn-2385","marks":["italic"],"text":"(This sentence read \"123 enforced laws (CP1–CP4)\" for part of 2026-08-22. CP1–CP4 is four laws; 123 is the whole-kernel total. The number was carried there by `scripts/check-law-counts.mjs`, which keeps published totals in sync with what the suites derive and cannot tell that a total has been dropped into a slot that wanted a subtotal. A sync gate makes counts CONSISTENT; it does not make a sentence TRUE, and the two are easy to mistake for each other.)"}]},{"id":"blk-2103","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2386","text":"So this is not a new language. It is the "},{"id":"spn-2387","marks":["bold"],"text":"runtime + authoring surface for a spec we already wrote."},{"id":"spn-2388","text":" The user's \"compose stacks like legos (invariant + laws + enforcement + feedback + adaptation)\" maps exactly onto CC2 compose."}]},{"id":"blk-2104","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2389","text":"The five facets already have engines (nothing greenfield)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-2106","spans":[{"id":"spn-2390","text":"facet"}]},{"id":"blk-2107","spans":[{"id":"spn-2391","text":"engine that provides it"}]},{"id":"blk-2108","spans":[{"id":"spn-2392","text":"symbol"}]}],"id":"blk-2105","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-2109","spans":[{"id":"spn-2393","marks":["bold"],"text":"invariant"}]},{"id":"blk-2110","spans":[{"id":"spn-2394","text":"Weave cost certificate ("},{"id":"spn-2395","marks":["code"],"text":"classify"},{"id":"spn-2396","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2397","marks":["code"],"text":"inferEAL"},{"id":"spn-2398","text":") + alethic "},{"id":"spn-2399","marks":["code"],"text":"consume"},{"id":"spn-2400","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-2401","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"}]},{"id":"blk-2111","spans":[{"id":"spn-2402","text":"the floor"}]}],[{"id":"blk-2112","spans":[{"id":"spn-2403","marks":["bold"],"text":"laws"}]},{"id":"blk-2113","spans":[{"id":"spn-2404","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box"},{"id":"spn-2405","text":" property-tested kernel laws — 109 as "},{"id":"spn-2406","marks":["code"],"text":"test/laws.mjs"},{"id":"spn-2407","text":" derives them"}]},{"id":"blk-2114","spans":[{"id":"spn-2408","text":"the algebra"}]}],[{"id":"blk-2115","spans":[{"id":"spn-2409","marks":["bold"],"text":"enforcement"}]},{"id":"blk-2116","spans":[{"id":"spn-2410","text":"the bridge "},{"id":"spn-2411","marks":["code"],"text":"select(...)"},{"id":"spn-2412","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-2413","marks":["code"],"text":"feasible ▸ permitted ▸ best"}]},{"id":"blk-2117","spans":[{"id":"spn-2414","text":"the verdict"}]}],[{"id":"blk-2118","spans":[{"id":"spn-2415","marks":["bold"],"text":"feedback"}]},{"id":"blk-2119","spans":[{"id":"spn-2416","marks":["code"],"text":"observe"},{"id":"spn-2417","text":" stage — "},{"id":"spn-2418","marks":["code"],"text":"evolution.mjs"},{"id":"spn-2419","text":" provenance hash-chain + PULSE bus"}]},{"id":"blk-2120","spans":[{"id":"spn-2420","text":"the trace"}]}],[{"id":"blk-2121","spans":[{"id":"spn-2421","marks":["bold"],"text":"adaptation"}]},{"id":"blk-2122","spans":[{"id":"spn-2422","marks":["code"],"text":"evolution.mjs"},{"id":"spn-2423","text":" "},{"id":"spn-2424","marks":["code"],"text":"evolve()"},{"id":"spn-2425","text":" — measured/priced/certified change (EV1–EV6)"}]},{"id":"blk-2123","spans":[{"id":"spn-2426","text":"the rewrite"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-2124","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2427","marks":["bold"],"text":"Crucial finding (de-risks v1):"},{"id":"spn-2428","text":" "},{"id":"spn-2429","marks":["code"],"text":"value.mjs"},{"id":"spn-2430","text":" already exports the operators CC2 needs — "},{"id":"spn-2431","marks":["code"],"text":"combine(a,b)"},{"id":"spn-2432","text":" (the "},{"id":"spn-2433","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-2434","text":" lattice merge), "},{"id":"spn-2435","marks":["code"],"text":"chain(a,b)"},{"id":"spn-2436","text":" (the sequential, phase-graded "},{"id":"spn-2437","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2438","text":"), and "},{"id":"spn-2439","marks":["code"],"text":"consume(v,req)"},{"id":"spn-2440","text":" (the alethic gate that produces "},{"id":"spn-2441","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-2442","text":"). CC2's "},{"id":"spn-2443","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-2444","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2445","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2446","text":" are these "},{"id":"spn-2447","marks":["italic"],"text":"lifted from raw Values to capabilities-with-holder-and-contract."},{"id":"spn-2448","text":" The hard algebra is done; v1 is a thin lift + a type-compatibility check + a surface."}]},{"id":"blk-2125","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2449","text":"2. The brick (the unit of composition)"}]},{"id":"blk-2126","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2450","text":"A "},{"id":"spn-2451","marks":["bold"],"text":"brick"},{"id":"spn-2452","text":" is a capability annotated with everything needed to compose it lawfully:"}]},{"id":"blk-2127","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Brick = {\n  id, holder,                       // who provides it (CC2 provenance tag)\n  contract: { accepts_from, feeds_into },   // the |> hand-off types\n  value: V({ pi, beta, kappa, sigma }),     // alethic modal value (box-and-box)\n  cost:  WeaveCostCertificate,              // the invariant — see §2.1 (the atom this whole layer rests on)\n  utility,                                   // axiological score input\n  laws:  [...lawIds],                        // which rung laws it claims (conformance)\n  floor: [...forbidden],                     // un-weakenable deontic/reflexive constraints\n}"},{"id":"blk-2128","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2453","text":"A brick is exactly the [&] "},{"id":"spn-2454","marks":["code"],"text":"CC1"},{"id":"spn-2455","text":" capability + holder (CC2 §2.1) + its Weave cost cert. The five facets are all present: cost = invariant, laws = laws, value/floor = enforcement inputs, and the brick gains feedback/adaptation when wrapped in a loop (§3, "},{"id":"spn-2456","marks":["code"],"text":"⟲"},{"id":"spn-2457","text":")."}]},{"id":"blk-2129","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2458","text":"2.1 "},{"id":"spn-2459","marks":["code"],"text":"WeaveCostCertificate"},{"id":"spn-2460","text":" — the "},{"id":"spn-2461","marks":["code"],"text":"Brick.cost"},{"id":"spn-2462","text":" contract (build this FIRST)"}]},{"id":"blk-2130","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2463","text":"The certificate is the atom; the compose runtime is the molecule. It must exist before any composition. Canonical, IR-hash-bound, "},{"id":"spn-2464","marks":["bold"],"text":"fail-closed"},{"id":"spn-2465","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-2131","kind":"code","language":"ts","text":"type WeaveCostCertificate = {\n  subject:  { kind: \"weave-ir\"; hash: string };          // cert is BOUND to the IR hash;\n                                                          // any IR change invalidates it\n  analyzer: { name: \"weave-eal\" | \"weave-classify\" | \"weave-lal\"; version: string };\n  verdict:  {\n    certified:  boolean;       // did analysis succeed with a real bound?\n    total:      boolean;       // termination guaranteed\n    oracleFree: boolean;       // eal:true ⟹ reduces with no residual superposition\n    costClass:  \"poly\" | \"elementary\" | \"exponential\" | \"tower\" | \"unknown\";\n    ealDepth?:  number;        // certified elementary tower height (weave-eal)\n    polynomialDegree?: number; // measured today (weave-eal-degree); PROVEN once static LAL lands\n    rank?:      number;        // legacy STLC type-order proxy ONLY — not the certificate's class\n  };\n  policy:   { resourceDecision: \"allow\" | \"budget_check\" | \"escalate\" | \"annihilate\"; reason: string };\n  evidence: { source?: string; generatedAt: string; /* space for signer/signature later */ };\n};"},{"id":"blk-2132","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2466","marks":["bold"],"text":"Canonical vocabulary (one set, no synonyms):"},{"id":"spn-2467","text":" "},{"id":"spn-2468","marks":["code"],"text":"costClass"},{"id":"spn-2469","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2470","marks":["code"],"text":"ealDepth"},{"id":"spn-2471","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2472","marks":["code"],"text":"polynomialDegree"},{"id":"spn-2473","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2474","marks":["code"],"text":"certified"},{"id":"spn-2475","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2476","marks":["code"],"text":"oracleFree"},{"id":"spn-2477","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2478","marks":["code"],"text":"total"},{"id":"spn-2479","text":". Keep "},{"id":"spn-2480","marks":["code"],"text":"rank"},{"id":"spn-2481","text":" "},{"id":"spn-2482","marks":["italic"],"text":"only"},{"id":"spn-2483","text":" for the older STLC proxy. ("},{"id":"spn-2484","marks":["code"],"text":"classify"},{"id":"spn-2485","text":" currently returns "},{"id":"spn-2486","marks":["code"],"text":"{rank, rung, terr}"},{"id":"spn-2487","text":"; the certificate maps "},{"id":"spn-2488","marks":["code"],"text":"rung → costClass"},{"id":"spn-2489","text":" and surfaces "},{"id":"spn-2490","marks":["code"],"text":"eal"},{"id":"spn-2491","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2492","marks":["code"],"text":"depth"},{"id":"spn-2493","text":" from "},{"id":"spn-2494","marks":["code"],"text":"inferEAL"},{"id":"spn-2495","text":".)"}]},{"id":"blk-2133","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2496","marks":["bold"],"text":"Fail-closed is the default."},{"id":"spn-2497","text":" Uncertified / non-total / non-oracle-free / analyzer-error ⇒ "},{"id":"spn-2498","marks":["code"],"text":"resourceDecision: \"annihilate\""},{"id":"spn-2499","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-2500","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-2501","text":"). "},{"id":"spn-2502","marks":["bold"],"text":"Uncertified is vetoed, not a low score"},{"id":"spn-2503","text":" — utility can never resurrect it (this is the whole point of the floor). An explicit "},{"id":"spn-2504","marks":["code"],"text":"mode: \"production\" | \"development\""},{"id":"spn-2505","text":" may downgrade "},{"id":"spn-2506","marks":["code"],"text":"unknown → warn/override"},{"id":"spn-2507","text":" in dev, but "},{"id":"spn-2508","marks":["bold"],"text":"production unknown → `0̲`"},{"id":"spn-2509","text":", always."}]},{"id":"blk-2134","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2510","marks":["bold"],"text":"Resource-rung mapping"},{"id":"spn-2511","text":" (the "},{"id":"spn-2512","marks":["code"],"text":"policy.resourceDecision"},{"id":"spn-2513","text":"):"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-2136","spans":[{"id":"spn-2514","text":"static result"}]},{"id":"blk-2137","spans":[{"id":"spn-2515","text":"decision"}]}],"id":"blk-2135","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-2138","spans":[{"id":"spn-2516","marks":["code"],"text":"poly"},{"id":"spn-2517","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-2518","marks":["code"],"text":"ealDepth ≤ 1"},{"id":"spn-2519","text":" with safe bounds"}]},{"id":"blk-2139","spans":[{"id":"spn-2520","marks":["code"],"text":"allow"}]}],[{"id":"blk-2140","spans":[{"id":"spn-2521","marks":["code"],"text":"elementary"},{"id":"spn-2522","text":" above the cheap rung"}]},{"id":"blk-2141","spans":[{"id":"spn-2523","marks":["code"],"text":"budget_check"},{"id":"spn-2524","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-2525","marks":["code"],"text":"escalate"}]}],[{"id":"blk-2142","spans":[{"id":"spn-2526","marks":["code"],"text":"exponential"},{"id":"spn-2527","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-2528","marks":["code"],"text":"tower"}]},{"id":"blk-2143","spans":[{"id":"spn-2529","marks":["code"],"text":"escalate"},{"id":"spn-2530","text":" / cheaper-plan route"}]}],[{"id":"blk-2144","spans":[{"id":"spn-2531","text":"uncertified / not total / not oracle-free / analyzer error"}]},{"id":"blk-2145","spans":[{"id":"spn-2532","marks":["code"],"text":"annihilate"},{"id":"spn-2533","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-2534","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-2535","text":")"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-2146","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2536","text":"3. The connectors (the lego studs) — and their laws"}]},{"id":"blk-2147","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2537","text":"Four operators. The first two are CC2 §2; the laws are "},{"id":"spn-2538","marks":["italic"],"text":"already"},{"id":"spn-2539","text":" the box-and-box value laws, lifted."}]},{"id":"blk-2148","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2540","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-2541","text":" — combine (parallel) → "},{"id":"spn-2542","marks":["code"],"text":"combine"}]},{"id":"blk-2149","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2543","text":"Merge the joint capability set. Lattice join, holder-tagged."}]},{"id":"blk-2150","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2152","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2544","marks":["bold"],"text":"Laws (CC2 §2.1):"},{"id":"spn-2545","text":" "},{"id":"spn-2546","marks":["code"],"text":"A&B == B&A"},{"id":"spn-2547","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2548","marks":["code"],"text":"(A&B)&C == A&(B&C)"},{"id":"spn-2549","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2550","marks":["code"],"text":"A&A == A"},{"id":"spn-2551","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2552","marks":["code"],"text":"A&none == A"},{"id":"spn-2553","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-2151","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2154","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2554","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cost:"},{"id":"spn-2555","text":" resource rung "},{"id":"spn-2556","marks":["bold"],"text":"adds"},{"id":"spn-2557","text":" (two capabilities cost the sum); invariants "},{"id":"spn-2558","marks":["bold"],"text":"conjoin"},{"id":"spn-2559","text":" (κ must stay acyclic — a combine that creates a cycle is flagged "},{"id":"spn-2560","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberate"},{"id":"spn-2561","text":")."}]}],"id":"blk-2153","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-2155","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2562","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2563","text":" — pipeline (sequence) → "},{"id":"spn-2564","marks":["code"],"text":"chain"}]},{"id":"blk-2156","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2565","text":"Governed sequential composition. "},{"id":"spn-2566","marks":["bold"],"text":"The operator CC1 left lawless."}]},{"id":"blk-2157","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2159","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2567","marks":["bold"],"text":"Laws (CC2 §2.2):"},{"id":"spn-2568","text":" "},{"id":"spn-2569","marks":["code"],"text":"(X|>f)|>g == X|>(f|>g)"},{"id":"spn-2570","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2571","marks":["code"],"text":"X|>id == X"},{"id":"spn-2572","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2573","marks":["bold"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-2574","text":" commutative, "},{"id":"spn-2575","marks":["bold"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-2576","text":" idempotent."}]}],"id":"blk-2158","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2161","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2577","marks":["bold"],"text":"Feasibility:"},{"id":"spn-2578","text":" at each hand-off, producer "},{"id":"spn-2579","marks":["code"],"text":"feeds_into"},{"id":"spn-2580","text":" must match consumer "},{"id":"spn-2581","marks":["code"],"text":"accepts_from"},{"id":"spn-2582","text":", else the stage carries "},{"id":"spn-2583","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-2584","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-2585","marks":["bold"],"text":"annihilates the whole pipeline"},{"id":"spn-2586","text":" (alethic "},{"id":"spn-2587","marks":["code"],"text":"consume"},{"id":"spn-2588","text":"). A type-incompatible pipeline is not \"invalid\" — it "},{"id":"spn-2589","marks":["italic"],"text":"is"},{"id":"spn-2590","text":" the zero of the composition."}]}],"id":"blk-2160","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2163","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2591","marks":["bold"],"text":"Quantities (semiring):"},{"id":"spn-2592","text":" confidence = product, cost = sum, worst-case latency = max, composed end-to-end; compared against each step's "},{"id":"spn-2593","marks":["code"],"text":"requires"},{"id":"spn-2594","text":" (epistemic β-gate)."}]}],"id":"blk-2162","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-2164","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2595","marks":["code"],"text":"⟲"},{"id":"spn-2596","text":" — loop (PULSE nest)"}]},{"id":"blk-2165","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2597","text":"Wrap a brick (or a "},{"id":"spn-2598","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-2599","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2600","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2601","text":" tree) in a "},{"id":"spn-2602","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve → route → act → learn → consolidate"},{"id":"spn-2603","text":" cadence. This is what attaches "},{"id":"spn-2604","marks":["bold"],"text":"feedback"},{"id":"spn-2605","text":" (the "},{"id":"spn-2606","marks":["code"],"text":"learn"},{"id":"spn-2607","text":" phase → "},{"id":"spn-2608","marks":["code"],"text":"OutcomeSignal"},{"id":"spn-2609","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2610","marks":["code"],"text":"ReputationUpdate"},{"id":"spn-2611","text":" on the PULSE bus) and "},{"id":"spn-2612","marks":["bold"],"text":"adaptation"},{"id":"spn-2613","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-2614","marks":["code"],"text":"consolidate"},{"id":"spn-2615","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-2616","marks":["code"],"text":"evolution.mjs evolve()"},{"id":"spn-2617","text":"). Output is a "},{"id":"spn-2618","marks":["code"],"text":"*.pulse.json"},{"id":"spn-2619","text":" manifest, generated for free."}]},{"id":"blk-2166","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2620","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-2621","text":" — floor (implicit, on every operator)"}]},{"id":"blk-2167","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2622","text":"Any sub-brick that violates an invariant or busts budget annihilates to "},{"id":"spn-2623","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-2624","text":" — it does "},{"id":"spn-2625","marks":["bold"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-2626","text":" down-rank the parent; it kills that branch (the same floor pattern Weave→govern already uses)."}]},{"id":"blk-2168","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2627","marks":["bold"],"text":"Closure (why it's legos):"},{"id":"spn-2628","text":" the bridge is closed under composition — composing governed verdicts yields a governed verdict with a merged certificate. So a tree of bricks exposes the "},{"id":"spn-2629","marks":["italic"],"text":"same"},{"id":"spn-2630","text":" Brick interface and emits the "},{"id":"spn-2631","marks":["italic"],"text":"same"},{"id":"spn-2632","text":" six PULSE tokens. A brick of bricks is a brick."}]},{"id":"blk-2169","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2633","text":"4. The composite certificate"}]},{"id":"blk-2170","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2634","marks":["code"],"text":"compose(tree)"},{"id":"spn-2635","text":" returns one certificate for the whole assembly:"}]},{"id":"blk-2171","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"{ decision: <winning plan | 0̲>,\n  cost:  { rung: join(parts), ... },     // Weave: whole-tree cost class\n  value: V(...),                          // alethic: conjoined feasibility + κ\n  permitted: <bridge verdict>,            // box-and-box select(): feasible ▸ permitted ▸ best\n  annihilated: [...0̲ branches with σ tags],\n  record: <evolution.mjs hash-chain entry> }"},{"id":"blk-2172","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2636","text":"This is \"the verdict is the arithmetic\": the composite verdict is "},{"id":"spn-2637","marks":["italic"],"text":"computed"},{"id":"spn-2638","text":", not heuristic — cost from Weave, permission from the bridge, both over the same structural floor."}]},{"id":"blk-2173","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2639","text":"5. v1 scope"}]},{"id":"blk-2174","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2640","text":"Ordered so each slice is independently shippable and the risky/broad part comes last. "},{"id":"spn-2641","marks":["bold"],"text":"Slice 0 is the narrow resource-rung path a second review (ChatGPT, on `weave-and-the-ampersand-stack.md`) recommends doing first and alone"},{"id":"spn-2642","text":" — it is correct, and it is also exactly "},{"id":"spn-2643","marks":["code"],"text":"Brick.cost"},{"id":"spn-2644","text":", so it serves both goals."}]},{"id":"blk-2175","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2645","marks":["bold"],"text":"Slice 0 — the certificate (do this first, ships value on its own):"}]},{"id":"blk-2176","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2178","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2646","marks":["code"],"text":"weave/src/weave-certificate.mjs"},{"id":"spn-2647","text":" — given Weave IR, emit a deterministic "},{"id":"spn-2648","marks":["code"],"text":"WeaveCostCertificate"},{"id":"spn-2649","text":" (§2.1): IR hash, analyzer identity+version, "},{"id":"spn-2650","marks":["code"],"text":"costClass"},{"id":"spn-2651","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2652","marks":["code"],"text":"ealDepth"},{"id":"spn-2653","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2654","marks":["code"],"text":"polynomialDegree"},{"id":"spn-2655","text":", fail-closed "},{"id":"spn-2656","marks":["code"],"text":"resourceDecision"},{"id":"spn-2657","text":". Pure, no new runtime."}]}],"id":"blk-2177","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2180","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2658","text":"Tests ("},{"id":"spn-2659","marks":["code"],"text":"weave/test/"},{"id":"spn-2660","text":"): cheap/poly term → "},{"id":"spn-2661","marks":["code"],"text":"allow"},{"id":"spn-2662","text":"; expensive term → "},{"id":"spn-2663","marks":["code"],"text":"escalate"},{"id":"spn-2664","text":"; unknown/rejected term → "},{"id":"spn-2665","marks":["code"],"text":"annihilate"},{"id":"spn-2666","text":"; "},{"id":"spn-2667","marks":["bold"],"text":"hash changes when IR changes"},{"id":"spn-2668","text":" (binding test)."}]}],"id":"blk-2179","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2182","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2669","text":"Harden the "},{"id":"spn-2670","marks":["code"],"text":"surface/weave_govern.exs"},{"id":"spn-2671","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-2672","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box"},{"id":"spn-2673","text":" resource-rung path to consume the certificate (not re-parse strings), and assert "},{"id":"spn-2674","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-2675","text":" annihilation happens "},{"id":"spn-2676","marks":["italic"],"text":"before"},{"id":"spn-2677","text":" utility can resurrect an option. Update "},{"id":"spn-2678","marks":["code"],"text":"proofs/"},{"id":"spn-2679","text":" receipts: certified-cheap wins & runs · high-utility exponential annihilated · uncertified annihilated · refused plan run manually detonates."}]}],"id":"blk-2181","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-2183","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2680","marks":["bold"],"text":"Slice 1+ — the compose runtime (the lego layer, on top of Slice 0):"}]},{"id":"blk-2184","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2186","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2681","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box/compose.mjs"},{"id":"spn-2682","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-2683","marks":["code"],"text":"composeAnd"},{"id":"spn-2684","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2685","marks":["code"],"text":"composePipe"},{"id":"spn-2686","text":", "},{"id":"spn-2687","marks":["code"],"text":"composeTree"},{"id":"spn-2688","text":", lifting "},{"id":"spn-2689","marks":["code"],"text":"combine"},{"id":"spn-2690","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2691","marks":["code"],"text":"chain"},{"id":"spn-2692","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2693","marks":["code"],"text":"consume"},{"id":"spn-2694","text":" from Values to Bricks, with the "},{"id":"spn-2695","marks":["code"],"text":"feeds_into"},{"id":"spn-2696","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2697","marks":["code"],"text":"accepts_from"},{"id":"spn-2698","text":" check and semiring quantity composition."}]}],"id":"blk-2185","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2188","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2699","marks":["code"],"text":"test/compose-laws.mjs"},{"id":"spn-2700","text":" — CC2 §2 conformance (assoc/idem/identity for "},{"id":"spn-2701","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-2702","text":"; assoc/identity + infeasible⇒"},{"id":"spn-2703","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-2704","text":" for "},{"id":"spn-2705","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2706","text":"). Property-tested, same harness as the kernel suite. "},{"id":"spn-2707","marks":["bold"],"text":"Shipped:"},{"id":"spn-2708","text":" 101 enforced (CA1–CA4, CP1–CP4, CX1–CX7, CD1–CD17, VX1–VX5, QX1–QX6, AD1–AD5, CERT1–CERT40, TREE1–TREE4, WIRE0–WIRE7, + 1 anchor), 3 declared-open (CP5–CP7)."}]}],"id":"blk-2187","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2190","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2709","text":"Forge surface: brick palette + canvas; snap with "},{"id":"spn-2710","marks":["code"],"text":"& | ⟲"},{"id":"spn-2711","text":"; the six panels retarget to the "},{"id":"spn-2712","marks":["italic"],"text":"selected composite"},{"id":"spn-2713","text":" (Certificate = whole-tree cost, Governance = bridge over the tree, Evolve = mutate the tree); "},{"id":"spn-2714","marks":["bold"],"text":"+ a Feedback panel"},{"id":"spn-2715","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-2716","marks":["code"],"text":"learn"},{"id":"spn-2717","text":"→"},{"id":"spn-2718","marks":["code"],"text":"OutcomeSignal"},{"id":"spn-2719","text":")."}]}],"id":"blk-2189","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2192","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2720","text":"A worked demo: a 3-brick coalition ("},{"id":"spn-2721","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve |> certify |> govern"},{"id":"spn-2722","text":") composed, certified, governed, evolved — the [&] stack composing "},{"id":"spn-2723","marks":["italic"],"text":"itself"},{"id":"spn-2724","text":"."}]}],"id":"blk-2191","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":4},{"id":"blk-2193","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2725","marks":["bold"],"text":"Conservative composite-cost rule (CC2 §2.2; keep simple, don't overbuild):"},{"id":"spn-2726","text":" any uncertified child ⇒ the composed plan is uncertified ("},{"id":"spn-2727","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-2728","text":"); "},{"id":"spn-2729","marks":["code"],"text":"costClass"},{"id":"spn-2730","text":" = the max (worst) over children; numeric budgets "},{"id":"spn-2731","marks":["bold"],"text":"sum"},{"id":"spn-2732","text":" along "},{"id":"spn-2733","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2734","text":" (cost), "},{"id":"spn-2735","marks":["bold"],"text":"product"},{"id":"spn-2736","text":" for confidence, "},{"id":"spn-2737","marks":["bold"],"text":"max"},{"id":"spn-2738","text":" for latency. The certificate format must leave room for this — it does (§2.1) — but the multi-plan resolver itself is Slice 1, not Slice 0."}]},{"id":"blk-2194","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2739","marks":["bold"],"text":"Out (v1):"}]},{"id":"blk-2195","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2197","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2740","text":"Cross-agent "},{"id":"spn-2741","marks":["bold"],"text":"strategic"},{"id":"spn-2742","text":" ability ("},{"id":"spn-2743","marks":["code"],"text":"⟨⟨agents⟩⟩◊ ensure"},{"id":"spn-2744","text":", CC2 §3) — coalition admissibility against an adversary. v2."}]}],"id":"blk-2196","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2199","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2745","text":"Common-knowledge / coordinated-attack epistemic check (CC2 §3). v2."}]}],"id":"blk-2198","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2201","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2746","text":"CloudEvents transport on the PULSE bus ("},{"id":"spn-2747","marks":["code"],"text":"UMBRELLA.md"},{"id":"spn-2748","text":" item 5). Keep the local hash-chain substrate; wire transport later."}]}],"id":"blk-2200","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2203","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2749","text":"A real interpositional "},{"id":"spn-2750","marks":["code"],"text":"run"},{"id":"spn-2751","text":" host. Out — that's a separate stage."}]}],"id":"blk-2202","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-2204","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2752","marks":["bold"],"text":"Connects to, must not skip:"},{"id":"spn-2753","text":" the "},{"id":"spn-2754","marks":["code"],"text":"govern"},{"id":"spn-2755","text":" bridge ("},{"id":"spn-2756","marks":["code"],"text":"box-and-box compile"},{"id":"spn-2757","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2758","marks":["code"],"text":"govern"},{"id":"spn-2759","text":") is the dependency; compose sits "},{"id":"spn-2760","marks":["italic"],"text":"on top"},{"id":"spn-2761","text":" of it. The first technical task is lawful "},{"id":"spn-2762","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2763","text":" (item 1) — small and self-contained."}]},{"id":"blk-2205","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2764","text":"6. Review checklist (against CC2 before any code)"}]},{"id":"blk-2206","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2208","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2765","text":"[ ] Does "},{"id":"spn-2766","marks":["code"],"text":"Brick"},{"id":"spn-2767","text":" faithfully carry CC2 §2.1's holder + contract, and is "},{"id":"spn-2768","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-2769","text":" still idempotent with the holder tag as provenance (not a tiebreak)?"}]}],"id":"blk-2207","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2210","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2770","text":"[ ] Does "},{"id":"spn-2771","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2772","text":" match CC2 §2.2 exactly: associative, "},{"id":"spn-2773","marks":["code"],"text":"id"},{"id":"spn-2774","text":" identity, non-commutative, infeasible⇒"},{"id":"spn-2775","marks":["code"],"text":"0̲"},{"id":"spn-2776","text":", semiring quantities?"}]}],"id":"blk-2209","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2212","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2777","text":"[ ] Is the composite cost the "},{"id":"spn-2778","marks":["bold"],"text":"join"},{"id":"spn-2779","text":" of parts' Weave rungs (not a re-measurement)?"}]}],"id":"blk-2211","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2214","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2780","text":"[x] Are the new laws a strict superset check over the existing kernel laws (no contradiction with "},{"id":"spn-2781","marks":["code"],"text":"combine"},{"id":"spn-2782","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2783","marks":["code"],"text":"chain"},{"id":"spn-2784","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-2785","marks":["code"],"text":"consume"},{"id":"spn-2786","text":")? — both suites are green together; CP5–CP7 and CD6 are the declared exceptions and fail loudly rather than silently."}]}],"id":"blk-2213","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-2216","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2787","text":"[ ] Is v1 honest about what it is "},{"id":"spn-2788","marks":["italic"],"text":"not"},{"id":"spn-2789","text":" (no strategic/epistemic coalition admissibility yet)?"}]}],"id":"blk-2215","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-2217","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-2790","text":"7. What this ships for the stack"}]},{"id":"blk-2218","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-2791","text":"It closes the "},{"id":"spn-2792","marks":["code"],"text":"compose"},{"id":"spn-2793","text":" stage — the last lawless stage of the umbrella — at the runtime+surface level, advancing "},{"id":"spn-2794","marks":["code"],"text":"UMBRELLA.md"},{"id":"spn-2795","text":" \"what done looks like\" items 3 ("},{"id":"spn-2796","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-2797","text":" carries laws/holders/annihilation) and partway 4. It turns the Forge from a λ-term playground into the "},{"id":"spn-2798","marks":["bold"],"text":"authoring surface for CC2 coalitions"},{"id":"spn-2799","text":", where the demo composes the portfolio's own engines. And it does so as a "},{"id":"spn-2800","marks":["italic"],"text":"thin lift"},{"id":"spn-2801","text":" over already-shipped, already-property-tested algebra — not a new language."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierafhl76e62zpixg6vt2r2hjbwl7xhznfhvrst2qnzs4ggqdkkc7saq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}